  hearMoreName: EconomicHearMore04
  hearMoreText: Sustainable products demonstrate both ethical and financial responsibility.
    Transparent pricing models prevent exploitative practices, ensuring users only
    pay for what they truly need.  Efficient product design minimizes unnecessary
    resource use, cutting waste and overconsumption while creating software that
    delivers lasting value for both users and organizations.
